flowchart LR
    user[User Browser]
    superApp[React Super App UI]
    mfe[Superset Micro Frontend]
    iframe[Superset iframe]
    nginx[Nginx local gateway]
    backend[Go Fiber backend / proxy]
    mongo[(MongoDB sessions)]
    keycloak[Keycloak]
    ldap[(LDAP / OU)]
    supersetOp[Superset Operation]
    opDb[(Operation metadata DB)]
    warehouse[(Mock data warehouse)]

    user --> nginx
    nginx --> superApp
    superApp -->|Login| backend
    backend -->|Authorization Code Flow| keycloak
    keycloak -->|User federation| ldap
    keycloak -->|Code callback| backend
    backend -->|Encrypted tokens + session hash| mongo
    superApp --> mfe
    mfe --> iframe
    iframe -->|/api/superset/operation/*| nginx
    nginx --> backend
    backend -->|Load session and decrypt token| mongo
    backend -->|Authorization: Bearer Keycloak token| supersetOp
    supersetOp -->|Introspection| keycloak
    supersetOp --> opDb
    supersetOp --> warehouse

